  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9b79cc60b81622488b289a5b879f259, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nextSceneButton: {fileID: 1392815116}
  ContinueButton: {fileID: 1958848674}
  textDisplay: {fileID: 148682170}
  sentences:
  - " Richard : Ger\xE7ekten benden ayr\u0131lacak m\u0131s\u0131n, onca  ya\u015Fanm\u0131\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131
    hi\xE7e mi sayacaks\u0131n, ger\xE7ekten beni bu \u015Fehirde  yaln\u0131z b\u0131rak\u0131p
    Atinaya m\u0131 gideceksin?"
  - " Yapma! birka\xE7 kuru\u015F daha fazla kazanabilmek i\xE7in o i\u011Fren\xE7
    adam\u0131n yan\u0131na gitme."
  - " Hem belki orada tutunamazs\u0131n, \u015Fehrin yaln\u0131zl\u0131\u011F\u0131na
    g\xF6m\xFCl\xFCp, y\u0131llar\u0131n\u0131 mahfedersin."
  - ' Rosa : Gitmeliyim Richard.'
  - " Bu \u015Fehirde sefillik i\xE7indeyiz!, a\xE7\u0131z ve yoksuluz"
  - " Sevgi karn\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 doyurmuyor!, anla art\u0131k,Richard sen sadece
    a\u015Fk ile her \u015Feyin m\xFCmk\xFCn olabilece\u011Fini d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorsun
    fakat bu \xE7ocuksu bir hayalden ba\u015Fka bir \u015Fey de\u011Fil..."
  - " Richard : Ger\xE7ekten b\xF6yle mi d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorsun?"
  - ' ...'
  - "G\xF6r\xFC\u015Fmek \xFCzere Sevgilim."
